{"id":"shestoj","lemma":"шестой","pos":"adj","rank":2629,"glosses":["sixth"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/89/Ru-%D1%88%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%B9.ogg/Ru-%D1%88%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%B9.ogg.mp3","forms":{"neuter":"шестое","feminine":"шестая","plural":"шестые"},"examples":[{"text":"Июнь - шестой месяц года.","en":"June is the sixth month of the year.","words":[{"g":"June"},null,{"g":"month"},{"g":"year","l":"год"}]},{"text":"Два в шестой степени — шестьдесят четыре.","en":"Two to the sixth power is sixty-four.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1264770","words":[{"g":"two"},{"g":"in"},null,{"g":"degree, extent","l":"степень"},null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"sixty-four"]]},{"text":"Как вы думаете, у женщин развито шестое чувство?","en":"Do you believe that women have a sixth sense?","words":[{"g":"how / like"},{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"to think","l":"думать"},{"g":"at / by"},null,null,null,{"g":"sense, feeling"}]},{"text":"Откройте книги на восемьдесят шестой странице.","en":"Open your books to page 86.","words":[{"g":"to open","l":"открыть"},{"g":"book","l":"книга"},{"g":"on / at"},{"g":"eighty"},null,null]},{"text":"Мэри на тридцать шестой неделе.","en":"Mary is 36 weeks pregnant.","words":[null,{"g":"on / at"},{"g":"thirty"},null,null]}]}